<sync start=68140><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>As far as I am concerned, firstly,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　it is imperative for governments at all levels</font>
<sync start=71200><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>As far as I am concerned, firstly,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　it is imperative for governments at all levels</font>
